  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAUTAPO 2023 Empowerment av kvinnor/m&#xe4;n och accelerator av marknadssystem</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAUTAPO 2023 Empowerment of women/men and accelerator of market systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the proposal have not changed. They will continue to contribute to environmental protection, climate change adaptation and mitigation, and sustainable economic development in bolivia.

According to the reformulated proposal, the main expected results are:
* Enhanced and inclusive conservation, restoration and sustainable management and use of forests and biodiversity, inside and outside protected areas, including forest fire prevention and the implementation of climate change adaptation and mitigation efforts.
* Promote sustainable production models that allow the country to benefit from its natural resources in an ecologically sustainable manner.  
* Strengthen environmental governance and institutional structures and capacity for environmental protection, improve access to justice and human rights, and enhance the protection of the environment. 
* Increasing women&apos;s participation in decision-making and activities related to the environment, climate change and sustainable production.

At the end of the intervention, 205 family productive units will be benefited and the and the areas to be intervened will be 5 instead of 3 as in the initial proposal.

In addition a final phase has been added for achieving a sustainable closure of the program:
* Responsibly and efficiently conclude the program, under the comprehensive model implemented for the empowerment of women and men, with family productive units with quality products, equitable and competitive access to markets, in environments with gender equity, promoting their autonomy and cooperation in the market system.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att utveckla produktionsprotokoll och aff&#xe4;rsplaner f&#xf6;r att artikulera h&#xe5;llbara och milj&#xf6;v&#xe4;nliga produktiva initiativ, till nya marknader.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop production protocols and business plans to articulate sustainable and environmentally friendly productive initiatives, to new markets.</narrative>
  </description>
